{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"出埃及记","commonName":"出埃及记","title":"出埃及记","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"b842caeaed820b1509733186fc954ba411c1dca9ce02e60cbb8414f58e38e4ac","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1212},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西的歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，摩西和以色列人向耶和华唱歌说：",{"text":"我要向耶和华歌唱，因他大大战胜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将马和骑马的投在海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华是我的力量，我的诗歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也成了我的拯救。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是我的 神，我要赞美他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我父亲的 神，我要尊崇他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华是战士；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的名是耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"法老的车辆、军兵，耶和华已抛在海中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他特选的军长都沉于红海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深水淹没他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们如同石头坠到深处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你的右手施展能力，显出荣耀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你的右手摔碎仇敌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你大发威严，推翻那些起来攻击你的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你发出烈怒如火，烧灭他们像烧碎秸一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你发鼻中的气，水便聚起成堆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大水直立如垒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海中的深水凝结。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敌说：我要追赶，我要追上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要分掳物，我要在他们身上称我的心愿。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要拔出刀来，亲手杀灭他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫风一吹，海就把他们淹没；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们如铅沉在大水之中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，众神之中，谁能像你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能像你—至圣至荣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可颂可畏，施行奇事？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你伸出右手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地便吞灭他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你凭慈爱领了你所赎的百姓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你凭能力引他们到了你的圣所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外邦人听见就发颤；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"疼痛抓住非利士的居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，以东的族长惊惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的英雄被战兢抓住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦南的居民心都消化了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惊骇恐惧临到他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，因你膀臂的大能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们如石头寂然不动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候你的百姓过去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候你所赎的百姓过去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要将他们领进去，栽于你产业的山上—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，就是你为自己所造的住处；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，就是你手所建立的圣所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必作王，直到永永远远！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["米利暗的歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["法老的马匹、车辆，和马兵下到海中，耶和华使海水回流，淹没他们；惟有以色列人在海中走干地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["亚伦的姊姊，女先知米利暗，手里拿着鼓；众妇女也跟她出去拿鼓跳舞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["米利暗应声说：",{"text":"你们要歌颂耶和华，因他大大战胜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将马和骑马的投在海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["苦水"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["摩西领以色列人从红海往前行，到了书珥的旷野，在旷野走了三天，找不着水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["到了玛拉，不能喝那里的水；因为水苦，所以那地名叫玛拉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["百姓就向摩西发怨言，说：「我们喝什么呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["摩西呼求耶和华，耶和华指示他一棵树。他把树丢在水里，水就变甜了。 耶和华在那里为他们定了律例、典章，在那里试验他们；"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["又说：「你若留意听耶和华—你 神的话，又行我眼中看为正的事，留心听我的诫命，守我一切的律例，我就不将所加与埃及人的疾病加在你身上，因为我—耶和华是医治你的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["他们到了以琳，在那里有十二股水泉，七十棵棕树；他们就在那里的水边安营。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EXO/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}